// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3182918728" "My lands are not my own. My men are no longer loyal to me. I look around and find my path lost. I believe that you are here to aid me, yet I believe we need the guidance of the Oracle."
// AcceptString :
"P2213225545" "Consult the Oracle"
// SendOffString :
"P1861192541" "Take the boat to the mountain of the oracle. Seek out Sister Solaris and ask for her divinations. She will show us the path to victory."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1693053687" "You still need to take the boat to the Oracle. She, and she alone, will tell us how to escape this dark place."
// TaskTitle :
"P4141820948" "<color deepskyblue>Time's Arrow</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2804486264" "<color deepskyblue>The Oracle of Phoebas</color>"

