// Dialog :
"P3526932393" "You've rescued Sister Solaris and the other Sybils as well has consulting the Oracle. Return to Imperious for further instruction."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3784581198" "I do not know why I am surprised that Romulus would try and take over Point Phoebas and the Sybils. Perhaps I assumed that even he had limits to what he would do - a mistake I have made too often.  But never again.<br><br>What did the Oracle tell you? I hope it is of use to us."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3569207588" "The dark ones, the ones you called the Nictus, have infested the catacombs beneath this land. They seem to thrive from large black shadow crystals hidden within those tunnels. I believe this should be our next assault."
// AcceptString :
"P978899723" "Take out the shadow cysts"
// SendOffString :
"P1441517085" "I had heard rumors of these dark ones in the caves while I was still in power. I sent Romulus and a contingent of men to investigate. Only Romulus returned, cut and beaten, claiming he had faced a beast from Hades.<br><br>If I only knew then what I know now, that the cuts on Romulus were from my own men trying to defend themselves against that traitor!<br><br><color orange>I have spoken with Daedalus, my prized crafter, and it is his belief that if you destroy the shadow crystals, you will destroy the ability of the dark ones to survive in this realm."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3089871830" "Destroy the Shadow Cysts"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3608464671" "Romulus was once my most loyal aid. He would lead in my name when I travelled abroad, and when matters demanded that I stay at home, he would be my voice to peoples of far off lands.<br><br>His betrayal is maddening! I must not allow it to go on any longer. I must have my empire back. <color orange>Destroying those shadow crystals is the next step in returning me to the throne.</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P751716495" "<color deepskyblue>Shadows on the cave wall</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P792778677" "Destroying the crystals will destroy the dark ones' abilities to survive in these catacombs."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P71107988" "Do you question any of this?"
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3612742042" "Not on my life. I value it too much."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2040924984" "This is the last time that I argue with General Terentius."
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3894719026" "True, brother, but what did I do to be sent down here?"

