// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P137855356" "You've destroyed the Shadow Cysts. Return to Imperious for further instruction."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3896752863" "I could hear the screams of those creatures from here. You are a mean group of warriors; I have never seen any more fierce.<br><br>With the crystals destroyed and the dark ones weakened, I believe the power of Romulus is now threatened.<br><br>Now is the time we strike."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3857040062" "I have questioned many of Romulus' men you captured from the catacombs. They revealed some startling information.<br><br><color orange>Romulus is rallying the full force of his army to assault your own time.</color><br><br>He plans to use two <color orange>Incarnates</color> from your time to awaken two of his giant colossi. Perhaps you have heard of these men. They go by the names <color orange>Statesman</color> and <color orange>Lord Recluse</color>. These colossi are being crafted in the mountains of Vespillos Pass."
// AcceptString :
"P3291771678" "Stop Romulus"
// SendOffString :
"P2766185824" "The army waits in Vespillos Pass for a ship that will take them to your time. From there, they plan to capture these two men, bring them back here, and wake the sleeping giants.<br><br>You do not want this to happen, whatever your allegiance is to these two <color orange>Incarnates</color>. I have seen, first-hand, the devastation left behind by the forces of Romulus. I have called for help on this task.<br><br><color orange>You will be joined by my prized artisan, Daedalus.</color> He will assist you in your journey up the pass to the colossi."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1774488276" "Vespillos Pass is where we would take our dead. Only those who died in battle were allowed to go there. It is no wonder that Romulus could build these colossi there without our knowledge. The lands are forbidden to everyone, except myself and a few others, Romulus being one of the few.<br><br><color orange>Go there, stop Romulus and stop his men!</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2224748603" "<color deepskyblue>Vespillos Pass</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2984833643" "Romulus is rallying his troops for a full assault on your time.<br><br>They plan to use Statesman and Lord Recluse to power their giant colossi."
// Script Variable DisplayText :
"P1994411518" "Cimeroran Traitors"
// Script Variable PET_NAME :
"P723300503" "Daedalus"
// Script Variable PET_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1902148233" "<em t=3><em>Imperious sent me to aid you.<em t=3>Romulus is building the colossi on the other side of this ridge.<em>Be wary, his men are everywhere."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1470177690" "Have you seen those creations?"
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1473887318" "<em t=4><em>They are bigger than I ever thought possible."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2660937275" "General Atilius"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P567171660" "The rumors are true. Imperious can no longer fight his own battles.<em>He has called in help from another land."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3591134006" "Imperious! Here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - GeneralSurgeon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2573052039" "Generals"
