// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P654891198" "Romulus Augustus"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4000171196" "What have we here?<em>Imperious has sent his new champions to me.<em>I have never killed a time traveler before."
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1967949581" "You bleed like any man.<em>Only faster."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1428095976" "If I deposed the great and might Imperious, what chance do you have?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2652008712" "Cimerora is merely a single place, in a single time. We have others."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P739258078" "Soon we will even have your precious Paragon empire and your Rogue islands."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
