// 3 Nictus :
"P1233931678" "<shout d=4><color red><bgcolor black>Perhaps they do, Romulus."
// 5 Nictus :
"P1135358946" "<shout t=4 d=4><color red><bgcolor black>But I will make you stronger than even the gods themselves.</color>"
// 1 Romulus :
"P3792398531" "<em d=3>How is that--?"
// 1.5 Nictus :
"P3369498903" "<shout t=3 d=4><color red><bgcolor black>--I will show you!</color>"
