"P3739350326" "<color red><bgcolor black>I am...<scale 3.0><color red><bgcolor black> NICTUS!</color>"
// 5 Romulus :
"P1469390227" "<d=4><color red><bgcolor black>The champions shall  be a feast laid before me!</color>"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P461959456" "I am Nictus!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P4098872260" "The power of the heavens flows through me!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P576526490" "You can not kill that which can not die!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1051763894" "Immortality has many forms!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P1623000570" "Perhaps even gods can die."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P112323008" "Your lands shall be mine for the taking!"

