// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2854113171" "You have recaptured Castellum Quarter, the inner city of Cimerora. In doing so, you've defeated over 300 of Romulus' men and Romulus himself."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1075893283" "We have retaken the city, defeated Romulus and the dark ones and even sent those vile 5th Column back across time. Glorious!<br><br>The people of Cimerora owe you a debt beyond mere words. You came here owing me nothing, yet giving me back everything I had lost. Now I am the one in your debt.<br><br>I will make sure that your deeds and your memory are remembered throughout all of time."

